{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>【TGS2026】「《快打旋風6》×SUZUKI」攤位報導！蛛俐風格機車與布蘭卡造型卡車登場</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/0b032d778004cf2c74764f0404e13ac3fbeefd1eaddfd7f8ee58055c4edef1f2/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F146fce14a80f4a63812015831a0e54ed.jpg\"/><p>2026年9月17日（四）至20日（日）舉行的「 東京電玩展2026 」。 這次要為大家帶來的是「 SUZUKI 」攤位現場報導！現場展示了與《 快打旋風6 》合作的特殊設計車輛。</p><h3>「《快打旋風6》×SUZUKI」攤位報導！蛛俐風格機車與布蘭卡造型卡車登場</h3><p>SUZUKI 報紙</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/682df19b5adb2b1d9a33805ed43abc2c04de73b46ac1cdd4a5c54268038e7c2a/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F48aa94dac4ffa1965ca79f5649295409.jpg\"/><p>一進入「《快打旋風6》×SUZUKI」攤位，就拿到了一份 SUZUKI 報紙。 聽說現場展示了蛛俐機車與 布蘭卡 卡車。 讓人迫不及待想一探究竟！</p><p>數位貼紙與布蘭卡抱枕</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/b6bfdae38207b664023585c05393e3ed5b8f1fdb9ac8dcc3ccd15d0ce773ffa1/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F45cb4170706bfd537cffe6ed926234f9.jpg\"/><p>據說二輪攤位與四輪攤位各自都有發放數位貼紙。 另外，只要兩邊都成功收集，就能獲得印有布蘭卡圖案的原創抱枕作為贈品。</p><p>蛛俐機車</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/7b52a2b285b22f571dbdef86d127ff77d036a525d771e771528b755edd06bd39/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F26c1f5904b0ab259f566604f0a00c798.jpg\"/><p>首先來到二輪攤位參觀蛛俐機車！ 以黑白為主色調的車身上，隨處點綴著蛛俐代表性的紫色，整體帥氣得令人忍不住著迷。</p><p>布蘭卡卡車</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/751ecba95555161df44b292d31262a00c7e52785f2d805e0f3f485801324ebc2/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F8bdba9217ab8824267eae92103ed61c4.jpg\"/><p>接著移動到四輪攤位！</p><p>滿滿的布蘭卡抱枕</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/81638aba9e8954493746a2d923f7ee878e973388c15dd11206c3b58fcb1acabe/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F672e527dbe4737e2344b8dd1ff8005b0.jpg\"/><p>貨斗上堆滿了大量布蘭卡抱枕，讓人感受到對布蘭卡滿滿的愛。</p><p>從哪個角度看都充滿布蘭卡風格</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/63442fcc62648bdc70cd0cff5f274f5a7d310fdcc9ea87660a0d8cba22d62d55/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F7e26e7eb110f31196572fc87881cb9e3.jpg\"/><p>無論從哪個角度看，都能感受到布蘭卡代表性的橘色與綠色。如果這台車真的在街上行駛，絕對會讓人忍不住回頭看第二眼。</p><p>香蕉與布蘭卡娃娃</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/94600c15a285afca0b2a224ea9915fcb4eeb8e5658b5de1fd256962301dc6523/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F0c4aad9a24b151da1fdfea88bbf8cbdc.jpg\"/><p>車內還擺放著布蘭卡最愛不釋手的香蕉，以及布蘭卡娃娃。 真擔心駕駛時會看得太入迷，反而變成分心駕駛。</p><p>布蘭卡抱枕寶庫</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/2a5fe365390d3d9f73040b610746365534ba9c25f18cb0d973dbd5c56f6be068/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F0943276817bd6305a04c4112f50c77fe.jpg\"/><p>堆積如山的布蘭卡抱枕</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/062d32ed12aa90db4b2251ab95df2a20f9ba86b2d637a806302ee9aba97ac925/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Ff39492dfdf5aea681f05a9d1f67b042a.jpg\"/><p>攤位內各個角落都擺放著布蘭卡抱枕。</p><p>掃描 QR Code</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/e9ffcf31cce4d4507ba23fbc5b56cf77cf6a84a9c70c6622dead9f0a4e7d27c3/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F44243fe668fab95e54443326b8c02274.jpg\"/><p>成功拿到貼紙與抱枕</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/52f64798d29cd2a3a4b1f02e61e452496e14b4601471e9017149451c5903078d/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fa0c70c93fd68cdb0733b661a0f5858e4.jpg\"/><p>比想像中還要大</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/998729199d5e57ab618b532cd918b815533a267524a6dca821d986748e3ec480/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fa84fdcc46e6a7c379becabb9231e567d.jpg\"/><p>掃描攤位內的 QR Code 後，就成功拿到了貼紙與抱枕。 布蘭卡抱枕比想像中還要大，可愛到讓人覺得實際拿來使用都有點捨不得。 有了這個抱枕陪伴，感覺之後寫稿也能更加努力了。</p><p>以上就是「SUZUKI」攤位的現場報導！</p><p>🔸【TGS2026】「LINE GAME」攤位報導！與「表情貼小傢伙（Emoji之子）」面板合影，完成任務挑戰BIG抽獎 🔸【TGS2026】「AORUS」攤位報導！與Atata氏的「快打6」對戰會以及「FF7」「龍族教義 2」的試玩也有 🔸【TGS2026】「KIOXIA」攤位報導！「EXCERIA PLUS G2 行動 SSD」全新配色展示等精彩內容 🔸【TGS2026】「PayPal・Paidy」攤位報導！豪華獎品巨大扭蛋機與認識 PayPal 便利性的問答企劃 🔸【TGS2026】電影『快打旋風／真人版電影』特別活動報導！全新日語配音陣容等眾多資訊明朗</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-25T09:58:36.775959+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1033,"images":13,"source":"Yahoo 科技","fallback":"none"}}